{"2601820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escapen't", "steam_appid": 2601820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/2da3189f02fb2e2a2e24406e52546801.avif?t=1761953977\" width=1086 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escapen’t Is My Magnum Opus. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The perfect escape room.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will never escape it because there is no escape. It is essentially the only escape room you will ever need to play, because you can practically play it forever without getting anywhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.poster.avif?t=1761953977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.webm?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.mp4?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Escape Room Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in my masterpiece is a work of genius (my genius, of course) that will have you scratching your tiny little head. Words, shapes, logic, guns, and triangles - I use only the best contraptions for my tortur-I mean, øh, puzzle design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.poster.avif?t=1761953977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.webm?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.mp4?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Are Not Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > My velvety, intellectual voice will caress your ears, a rare treat in itself, truly worth the price of admission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear any other voices, then it must be something with your head and not someone in the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.poster.avif?t=1761953977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.webm?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.mp4?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Puzzles, Endless Fun and no way out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you happen to find a vent or open door to enter... uh, ignore them. They are irrelevant to your experience as my unpaid full time escape room enjoyer. There are no-one else here and you don't need to think about what happened to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/2da3189f02fb2e2a2e24406e52546801.avif?t=1761953977\" width=1086 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escapen’t Is My Magnum Opus. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The perfect escape room.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will never escape it because there is no escape. It is essentially the only escape room you will ever need to play, because you can practically play it forever without getting anywhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.poster.avif?t=1761953977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.webm?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.mp4?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Escape Room Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in my masterpiece is a work of genius (my genius, of course) that will have you scratching your tiny little head. Words, shapes, logic, guns, and triangles - I use only the best contraptions for my tortur-I mean, øh, puzzle design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.poster.avif?t=1761953977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.webm?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.mp4?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Are Not Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > My velvety, intellectual voice will caress your ears, a rare treat in itself, truly worth the price of admission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear any other voices, then it must be something with your head and not someone in the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.poster.avif?t=1761953977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.webm?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.mp4?t=1761953977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Puzzles, Endless Fun and no way out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you happen to find a vent or open door to enter... uh, ignore them. They are irrelevant to your experience as my unpaid full time escape room enjoyer. There are no-one else here and you don't need to think about what happened to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "YOU CANNOT ESCAPE - I made sure of that. Solve puzzles, gather clues, don’t crawl into ventilation shafts, and realize how trapped you are in this comedy-horror escape room, my magnum opus.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/0bd1d005dcc6cce1de0acf8c26ef746db9bafa26/header.jpg?t=1761953977", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s